Reflection 1: current report is not sufficient because ['The audit measures 
candidate-set sensitivity, but changing candidate distributions alone does not 
establish defective discrimination. Lexical candidates can differ in popularity,
text coverage and actual relevance. Report these distributions and narrow causal
interpretations; consider a lexical-versus-uniform comparison within the same 
frequency band.', 'Training-prefix targets may already have been supervised 
during fitting. Removing the target from inference input prevents direct input 
leakage but does not establish generalization. Also, full-training item 
frequencies include interactions occurring after historical audit endpoints; 
explicitly describe this as retrospective checkpoint diagnosis.', 'Production 
integration remains underspecified: the current adapter previously lacked 
category identity, replay batches and exported-loader access. The pseudocode 
also passes full sequence features and a flat candidate list to a position-wise 
scoring interface without specifying tensor shapes or gathering the MASK 
feature.', 'Reproducibility requires exact TF-IDF settings, metadata-to-item 
mapping, text normalization, feature cap, candidate seed derivation, 
history-length strata, bootstrap count and aggregation rules. Define how fewer 
than 500 positive-similarity neighbors are handled when at least 99 remain.', 
'The 15-second GPU cap does not bound lexical preparation, checkpoint loading or
total diagnostic runtime. Cache the single MASK representation per endpoint, use
sparse target-to-catalog retrieval, and predeclare completion rules so timeouts 
do not silently change paired comparison populations.', 'Three draws and at most
32 users per category provide limited evidence, especially after availability 
filtering and stratification. Report candidate overlap, pool sizes, directional 
hit flips and common-user denominators; repeated draws are not independent 
users. Any four-category macro diagnostic needs explicit equal-category 
aggregation.', 'Originality 4/10 is reasonable. Potential 7/10 is optimistic 
without a defined decision the audit will inform, while difficulty 3/10 
understates the unresolved serving, routing and metadata integration. Restore 
production diagnostic coverage first; no supplied evidence justifies replacing 
the idea with a training modification.'], generating follow-up queries
